  "bio": "Alana Loures is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Londrina, Brazil, renowned for her expertise in lettering and minimalist tattoos. Her fine line work is particularly distinguished, showcasing a delicate yet precise approach to tattooing that has garnered her a dedicated clientele at Studio Paulinho Tattoo. Clients seeking intricate and elegant body art will find Alana's meticulous attention to detail truly exceptional.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Londrina, Parana, Brazil\n\nTatuadora e Piercer Studio Paulinho Tattoo\nLondrina/PR\n@paulinhotattoo \n✍🏻 Traço fino",
